# Kstack's copy of passt's AppArmor profile for pasta, from contrib/apparmor/
# at passt 2026_10_02.cba3570: usr.bin.pasta with abstractions/pasta and
# abstractions/passt written out, since a system without the passt package has
# neither, renamed kstack_pasta and attached to Kstack's own pasta. pasta
# starts one program, the sandbox's bwrap, so it may execute the bwraps the
# sidecar runs and nothing else.
